@startuml
title US-002 - Invite member - SD level 2
hide footbox
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam maxMessageSize 75
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor #EAF2F8
skinparam ActorBackgroundColor #FEF9E7
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFF8DC
autonumber

actor "Admin" as Admin
participant "Web UI" as UI
participant "Nexo API" as API

note over UI, API
  Limit counting (members vs all active accounts) and concurrent\nactivation enforcement remain open.
end note
Admin -> UI: Register member email (email)
activate UI
UI -> API: POST /organizations/{organizationId}/invitations (InviteMemberDto)
activate API
alt Request accepted
    API --> UI: 201 Created (AccountDto)
else Invalid email
    API --> UI: 400 Bad Request
else Caller not authorized for organization
    API --> UI: 403 Forbidden
else Plan limit reached or email already registered
    API --> UI: 409 Conflict
else Persistence failure
    API --> UI: 500 Internal Server Error
end
deactivate API
alt Successful response
    UI --> Admin: Pending member account created (Invited)
else Error response
    UI --> Admin: Show validation, authorization, or operation error
end
deactivate UI
@enduml
